      "level": 2,
      "content": "7.1 Political Leaders"
    },
    {
      "type": "keyFacts",
      "title": "Key Takeaways",
      "items": [
        "Madhya Pradesh is the birthplace and arena of eminent political figures including Dr. B.R. Ambedkar (Mhow), Atal Bihari Vajpayee (Gwalior), and Chandra Shekhar Azad (Bhabhra).",
        "The state boasts a glorious musical and artistic tradition led by legends like Tansen, Ustad Alauddin Khan, Kumar Gandharva, and Raja Mansingh Tomar.",
        "Literary giants such as Kalidasa, Makhanlal Chaturvedi, Harishankar Parsai, and Gajanan Madhav Muktibodh significantly shaped Indian literature.",
        "Sports personalities from MP, including hockey legend Captain Roop Singh and cricketer Mushtaq Ali, have brought international honors to India."
      ],
      "id": "ugipfw8"
    },
