    {
      "type": "examAlert",
      "items": [
        "Birthplaces of key personalities are frequently asked: Dr. B.R. Ambedkar (Mhow/Ambedkar Nagar), Chandra Shekhar Azad (Bhabhra, Alirajpur), and Makhanlal Chaturvedi (Babai, Narmadapuram).",
        "Major music festivals and their associated locations: Tansen Samaroh (Gwalior), Alauddin Khan Samaroh (Maihar), and Kalidas Samaroh (Ujjain).",
        "Literary awards and newspapers associated with figures like Makhanlal Chaturvedi (editor of 'Karmaveer') are high-yield MPPSC topics."
      ],
